[[2047,127,64,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The main beam headlamps circuit is operated\nby the steering column switch unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>When the switch is turned to the main beam\nposition, or when the &#x27;flashing&#x27; contact is closed, the line which\nsupplies the (left) \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and (right) \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               headlamps\nreceives a supply controlled by the ignition. - - Each circuit is\nprotected by a fuse for the junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F7</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              for\nthe left lamp and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F6</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               for the right one.</p><p>The suppy line for the left headlamp also\nsends a signal to the rev counter module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 4 of connector\nB) to light up the &#x27;main beam headlamps on&#x27; warning light.</p>"]]